# Delvers S2E00 — Cassius at the Guild

**Source-identity follow-up, 2026-10-27:** The [S2E02–S2E00 batch check](../../reports/DELVERS_S2E02_S2E00_SOURCE_IDENTITY_2026-10-27.md#s2e00) verifies both complete local exports against their recorded Git blobs after CRLF-to-LF conversion only, and verifies both source paths in the recorded source commit. Raw bytes differ in line endings. This independently confirms local content correspondence with the originally pinned source revision. Earlier provenance statements remain dated history. Prior interpretive coverage, inter-ASR measurements, played cutoff and audio status are unchanged.

**Archive identity:** `Delvers S2E00. Cassius at the Guild`, retained as **S2E00** in the owner-normalized source inventory. **Recording type: entirely narrated, in-universe guild interlude / cutaway**, without a played party session or player-character dialogue. The final speaker announces **“next week” will be the *final episode of Season One***. Thus **archive placement is not the story-time placement**: events occur **while the Darkest Delvers undertake the All-Bronze operation at the kuo-toa village**, before the S1E12 finale/debrief. Do **not** turn it into the opening adventure of Season Two or advance the first-arc endpoint. Short promotional outro is **out of universe**.

**Evidence status (2026-10-25):** Both entire processed SRTs read in order through their respective endings; **no MP3 audio listened**, original publisher date, MP3/SRT time alignment, written guild hierarchy, or voice performance verified. Proper names and distant historical references are **ASR-provisional**. [ASR comparison](../../reports/DELVERS_S2E00_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-25.md) · [Delvers review queue](../REVIEW_QUEUE.md) · [first-arc synthesis](../narrative/SEASON_ONE_ARC.md).

